"Murmur is a mleirt Avowed, a giant four-armed mole, living at the Art'h Residence."
"Murmur has glossy bronze fur, no visible ears and pinkish tentacle-whiskers on the snout."
"Murmur speaks only through the System and likes being called Murmur."
"Murmur wanders every room, tidies, and grabs and sniffs residents; Alden guesses housekeeper."
"Called Grandpa-Grandpa, Murmur often cared for Jeneth and his siblings as children."
